### ==========================================
### 1. WALLET ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### Get or Create Wallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token = {{token}}

{
  "orgId": 1,
  "currency": "KES"
}

### Get Wallet by Organization ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{orgId}}
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Credit Wallet (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/credit
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token = {{adminToken}}

{
  "orgId": 1,
  "amount": 5000.00
}

### Debit Wallet (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/debit
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token = {{adminToken}}

{
  "orgId": 1,
  "amount": 1000.00
}

### Get Wallet Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/1/stats
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Get Wallet Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{orgId}}/overview
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Check Wallet Existence
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{orgId}}/exists
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Check Sufficient Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{orgId}}/balance-check?amount=700
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Clear Pending Balance (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{orgId}}/clear-pending
Cookie: token = {{adminToken}}

### Reset Wallet (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{orgId}}/reset
Cookie: token = {{adminToken}}

### Get Total Platform Pending Liability (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/platform/pending-liability
Cookie: token = {{adminToken}}


### ==========================================
### 2. PAYOUT ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### Request Payout
POST {{baseUrl}}/payouts
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token = {{token}}

{
  "orgId": 1,
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "payoutMethodId": 1
}

### Get Pending Payouts (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts/pending
Cookie: token = {{adminToken}}

### Bulk Update Payout Status (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/payouts/bulk-status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token = {{adminToken}}

{
  "payoutIds": [1, 2],
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Get Organization Payouts
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts/org/1
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Get Latest Payout for Organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts/org/1/latest
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Get Payout Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts/org/1/count
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Get Total Paid Out Amount
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts/org/1/total-paid
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Get Payouts by Status (Pending / Completed / Failed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts/org/1/status/Completed
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Get Payout by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/payouts/1
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Update Payout Status (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/payouts/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token = {{adminToken}}

{
  "status": "Completed",
  "transactionReference": "MPESA_TXN_987654321"
}


### ==========================================
### 3. PAYOUT METHODS ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### Add Payout Method
POST {{baseUrl}}/payout-methods
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token = {{token}}

{
  "orgId": 1,
  "accountType": "M-Pesa",
  "accountNumber": "254712345678",
  "accountName": "Gakenye Ndiritu",
  "isDefault": true
}

### Get Organization Payout Methods
GET {{baseUrl}}/payout-methods/org/1
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Get Default Payout Method
GET {{baseUrl}}/payout-methods/org/1/default
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Count Payout Methods
GET {{baseUrl}}/payout-methods/org/1/count
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Get Payout Method by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/payout-methods/1
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Set Default Payout Method
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/payout-methods/1/default
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token = {{token}}

{
  "orgId": 1
}

### Update Payout Method
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/payout-methods/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}

{
  "orgId": 1,
  "accountNumber": "254798765432"
}


### Delete Payout Method
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/payout-methods/1?orgId=1
Cookie: token = {{token}}

### Validate Payout Method Ownership
GET {{baseUrl}}/payout-methods/1/validate/1
Cookie: token = {{token}}